# ── Secrets. This repo is PUBLIC and mirrors 1:1 to GitHub Pages. ──────────
# The Weedmaps client_secret is ALSO the inbound webhook HMAC key, so leaking
# it lets anyone forge a signed order webhook at us. Nothing below is ever
# committed, even from a sandbox account.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.token
.token_cache.json
*.pem
*.key

# ── Backing service artefacts ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# The integration service (dev-hyperwolf/wm-integration) runs beside this repo
# during a live demo. Its database is tens of megabytes and its logs carry
# request payloads; neither belongs in a static site.
*.sqlite3
*.sqlite3-*
*.log
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/

# ── OS noise ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
node_modules/
probe/

# Residue of a truncated `sed -n '<a>,+Np' file > ...` — the shell takes the
# tail of the range as a FILENAME and silently writes a 35KB file named after a
# line of source. Two of these were committed tonight; one reached a repo that
# mirrors 1:1 to GitHub Pages. Ignore the shape so a third does not.
indow.*
*,+[0-9]*p
